     UBL Invoice, XRechnung 3.0 CIUS, expected VALID (clean) under the German
     profile. This is the EXPORT-OUTSIDE-THE-EU fixture (VAT category G): a
     German seller invoicing a business in a NON-EU third country (Switzerland)
     for goods physically exported out of the Union. The supply is VAT-exempt as
     an Ausfuhrlieferung (§ 4 Nr. 1a i.V.m. § 6 UStG, EU VAT Directive art. 146),
     so every line carries VAT category code G ('Free export item, tax not
     charged') at rate 0 and the invoice shows ZERO VAT.

     It exercises the G family that the AE reverse-charge, the K
     intra-community and the S/Z/E shapes never touch:
       * BG-4 SELLER + BG-6 seller contact + BT-31 seller VAT id (DE000000000,
         VAT-scoped) — BR-G-02 demands a VAT-SCOPED Seller identifier (BT-31)
         or a tax-representative VAT id (BT-63); unlike BR-Z/BR-E it does NOT
         accept an any-scheme / tax-registration fallback (same scoping as
         BR-IC-02 but with NO buyer-VAT-id conjunct — an export buyer in a
         third country has no EU VAT id, so BG-7 carries none),
       * 2x BG-25 invoice lines, BOTH with BT-151 line VAT category = G and
         BT-152 line VAT rate = 0 (BR-G-05),
       * exactly ONE BG-23 VAT breakdown with BT-118 category G, BT-116 taxable
         = Σ G line nets, and BT-117 tax amount = 0.00 (BR-G-08/09),
       * the mandated export exemption reason on that breakdown: BT-121 code
         VATEX-EU-G (on the CEF VATEX list, BR-CL-22) AND the BT-120 reason
         text (BR-G-10, presence-required).
     BT-84 is the ISO 13616 documentation example IBAN (valid check digits), so
     the German SEPA IBAN check (BR-DE-19) is satisfied and the invoice is clean.

     ARITHMETIC (all internally consistent, EUR, VAT = 0 throughout):
       line 1 (G): 15 x 600.00 = 9000.00 -> BT-131 = 9000.00
       line 2 (G): 30 x  80.00 = 2400.00 -> BT-131 = 2400.00
       BT-106 sum of line nets = 9000 + 2400                  = 11400.00
       G breakdown base BT-116 = 9000 + 2400 = 11400.00 -> BT-117 = 0.00
       BT-109 tax exclusive = 11400.00 = sole breakdown base
       BT-110 total VAT = 0.00
       BT-112 tax inclusive = 11400.00 + 0.00 = 11400.00 = BT-115 payable -->
